{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7a429176e3abe86544c35ed775db9885781c2bd62e0858c7fc049d101d9b35f1", "ja": "（遊園地のハロウィンイベントが終わった。\nひなたの魔女、子供たちに大人気だったな……！）", "zh": "（游乐园的万圣节活动结束了。\n日向扮演的魔女大受孩子们欢迎……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "98baf06d40fda6d67b1e75713975040d2ccda9227ccba5599dba0266cd12fd99", "ja": "お疲れさんでした、{$P$}。\n今日も色々とありがとうねぇ。", "zh": "辛苦你了，{$P$}。\n今天也有很多事要向你道谢哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3ccd4a4fdb4649c210ca1706e530676dc4e5562415ab052bc574701bfc48d1b1", "ja": "こちらこそ。\nひなたのおかげで、すごく盛り上がっ……", "zh": "我才要道谢。\n多亏了日向，气氛很热烈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5e367eb90be971e31192ad013317dc86e28a7823af092dec98159a7d36fd9254", "ja": "ヒック！", "zh": "嗝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "d1bddd86a97707b87c54d091be037d3cd573a2fdcda8bb039053861f6cc65279", "ja": "ん、{$P$}？　どうかしたのかい？", "zh": "嗯？{$P$}，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5ac2cf491e31d820d848db599acd6a10388258236f1a24e2a6de12410e7d109b", "ja": "あ、ああ、すまん……ヒック！\nじつは少し前から、しゃっくりが止まらな……ヒック！", "zh": "呃，嗯嗯，抱歉……嗝！\n其实从刚才开始，我就不停在打嗝……嗝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "f49de8701ca67c166c7e014904051b1edaf6f31b3c03e3ec6acd7bab8ca3ca21", "ja": "ありゃ～、そりゃ困ったねぇ。そういえば、\n前にばあちゃんが、何か言ってたっけなぁ。", "zh": "哎呀～那真是伤脑筋哪。\n这么说来，以前奶奶好像有说过什么来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "81ba90e1243f695a394390bb1847e9ebb5ae01f4c1b59454e8a6bac731c0b5b6", "ja": "確かね、しゃっくり100回したら……。\nどうにかなるって……何だっけなぁ？", "zh": "我记得是说，要是打嗝100下……\n好像就会发生什么事……是什么事哪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0a8ec096d03ae16f8d5829faff9399d9662a20e61dc2998af16ad07445af5f4e", "ja": "ああ、100回したら死んじゃうとかいう、\nウワ……ヒック！", "zh": "哦，打嗝100下就会死掉的，\n那个谣……嗝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "6a14e6ced6b03175fe5f6605d0d225426e403cfcce34d0435b255f0146f32319", "ja": "ええっ！？　し、死んでしまうのかい！？\nそんなの、絶対ダメだよぉ、{$P$}！", "zh": "咦咦！？会、会死掉吗！？\n那绝对不行哪，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d1366bb641a9f0fd6caaafc104bc4f4db821f086811bf126ea488c44b6fb87df", "ja": "いやいやいや、大丈……ヒック！", "zh": "不不不，我没事……嗝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "afd464421bcbb7d813b7628acfcdb2f60859469791c12b7fec6b525df2ee90de", "ja": "えっと、したっけ、えっと……。\nわっ、わっ！　わぁ～～～～っ！", "zh": "我想想。那，该怎么办哪……\n哇，哇！哇～～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1012_p", "source_sha256": "897d76fa4a78e2e6fee9b48856be4ffcf3833c5d0170f39a9e8354e9ace834b0", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ？　ひな……ヒック！", "zh": "怎、怎么了？日向……嗝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "dabb02b4fd45dae7ab92705c337d890540a294800c7705212c67b9b3a2b5b9cf", "ja": "うう、止まってないべさ……。ごめんねぇ。あたしが、\n人をビックリさせるのがヘタなばっかりに……。", "zh": "呜呜，没停下来哪……\n抱歉哪，都怪我太不会吓人了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6035657c8f684dc5f0745354e912a22717e2a15fa79f4f3ce01c86abdc0ece6e", "ja": "ああ、驚いたら止まるっていうアレ……ヒック！", "zh": "哦哦，原来是那个吓一跳治打嗝的方法……嗝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "6cd2cf5f7f472bbd63f744818ad2fdd6bf2d184786aa2541a02b7c3cb7963001", "ja": "どうしたらいいんだろか。{$P$}が\n死んでしまったら、あたし……！", "zh": "该怎么办才好哪。\n要是{$P$}死掉了，我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "4a9daf7cbe90c7cd95a8a59ead7109386cc46d9f44733c08bef1f4f5d732dd21", "ja": "うわあああ～～～んっ！", "zh": "呜哇啊啊啊～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c24f9f8b1a3a266bfa7ddf7bd4b1ae5075b50fd6cb523e4542efa9e0395d9eba", "ja": "うわっ！？　だ、大丈夫だって！　ただのウワサと\nいうか、冗談みたいなモノだから、泣かないでくれ！", "zh": "哇！？就、就跟你说我没事嘛！\n那只是个迷信，或者该说是玩笑话，你不要哭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "5c453a03de6cf3d7fc58651b9977c20a35a5e5fddb45ba9832eede50b5a3c6d3", "ja": "……どうだろか？\nしゃっくり、止まったかい？", "zh": "……怎样哪？\n你停止打嗝了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e03025ded1e9694c1bb0b8c18f6d25aa3948d736a857cdf517a0c7b9aada967f", "ja": "ん？　あれ？　……おお、止まってる！\nそうか、演技だったんだな。ありがとう、ひなた！", "zh": "嗯？奇怪？……哦哦，停下来了！\n原来如此，你刚刚是在演戏啊。谢谢你，日向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "303cdcd4459f357ff971706fbe98a31a7911ef00d158a618e75f3031815e587e", "ja": "ぐすっ……えへへ、よかったよぉ。これからも……\nいつまでも元気でいてねぇ、{$P$}。", "zh": "呜……嘿嘿，真是太好了哪。\n你今后……也要常保活力喔，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0053_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a80107399f87c07e2e137653e797d7bed9b8f55d147cec72bd96244c3a2afe10", "ja": "（ひなたがこんな風に、人を驚かせられるとはな。\n目に涙まで浮かべて……ん？）", "zh": "（没想到日向居然这么会吓人啊。\n她甚至眼眶都泛泪了……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
